# Platform admin (SyncOps) — private

- **Never** show platform admin email/password on login or any user-facing UI.
- Source of truth: `lib/platform/admin.ts` (`PLATFORM_HARDCODED_ADMIN`).
- When the user asks for platform admin / SyncOps admin login credentials, read that file and show email + password from there.
- Do not put these credentials back into the login form, marketing pages, or `.env*.example` comments.
